      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POP DIVA (4) is in sizzling form lately, rocketing around this track in 15.88 to score two back then following on with a 21.64 win over 381m at this track. Flying lately and looks a key chance again. BLUE AND BOUJEE (5) made light work of the tricky draw with a scorching early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing second (21.73) at this track over 381m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Hard to beat again. MY PADDY BOY (1) is a fast dog well performed over the sprint races. Kept coming to finish sixth over 400m at Mandurah (25.39) latest in a Grade 5. Form at the trip strong including six wins. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from two starts. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. SOUTHERN STAR (2) has strong credentials at this circuit over this journey.",
